{"page_content": "Calculation of PEClocalsoii\n\nFor calculating the PECs, the approach described in Appendix A.16-2.3.6 should be followed, using Equation R.16-75.\n\nA.16-2.4.3 Calculation of concentration in groundwater\n\nThe calculation of concentration in groundwater should be carried out as explained in Appendix A.16-2.3.7.\n\nA.16-2.4.4 Release and exposure to surface water\n\nA.16-2.4.4.1. Release to surface water compartment\n\nThere are two sources of releases to water:\n\ne Direct release via drift when the application method is spraying\n\ne Indirect release via runoff\n\nThe release amount to water from drift is estimated as:\n\nInput_drift = APPL_eq x Drift%\n\nEquation R.16-76\n\nWhere:\n\n_ APPLrateyear APPL_eq = APPLnumber\n\nExplanation of symbols", "metadata": {"doc_id": "ed43910d-396a-4df5-b7bf-9d75f6dd814b", "content_type": "CompositeElement", "filename": "IR_CSR_R16_V4_FINAL.pdf"}}